# Whenever agent needs to run a shell command always look to execute a faster option command like the many tools written in rust that has the same functionality as native shell commands.

**Prefer:**

* fd over find
* eza over ls
* ag over grep
* z over cd
* bat over cat
* sd over sed
* dust over du
* dua over du
* procs over ps
* zoxide over cd 
* hyperfine over time
* tokei over cloc/wc
* dog over dig
* difftastic over diff
* choose over cut
* xcp over cp

